      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PERFECT RATIO (1) doesn't have the best strike-rate. Better run when finding the frame last time though, finishing second (35.38) at Sandown. Some good form is emerging from her last run. Top chance in this line up. THANK YOU BRIAN (2) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing seventh (43.16) in a Grade 5 at Sandown. The form out of last race has been strong. Should be in this for a long way. FAST REPLY (3) settled midfield in the run and boxed on to finish there when 4th (35.11) at The Meadows. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings five times from six starts. Has ability and is one of the better chances. CRUZADO (8) is right in the mix.",
